  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance for Myanmar Muslims from Rakhine State and Special At-Risk Groups in Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will deliver humanitarian assistance to Myanmar Muslims from Rakhine State and special at-risk groups to contribute to their protection as project beneficiaries. The project will aim at improving the physical and psychosocial well-being of the migrants by providing the assistance of physical health, mental health and psychosocial support, food and supplemental nutrition, non-food items and water, sanitation and hygiene.</narrative>
  </description>
